---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import {dropped,toHref} from '../lib';
---
<Layout title="Dropped entries | PsychTerms"><div class="article-wrap prose"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href={toHref()}>psychterms.org</a> / Dropped</p><h1>Dropped entries</h1><p>These entries are excluded from term pages, search and the definition downloads. Status moves forward or off; a dropped entry is never quietly restored.</p>{dropped.length ? <ul>{dropped.map((entry:any)=><li data-entry-content><strong>{entry.term}</strong>: {entry.reason}<p class="small">{entry.sources.map((source:any)=><span><a href={source.url}>{source.citation}</a> · <a href={source.licence_url}>{source.licence}</a> </span>)}</p></li>)}</ul> : <p>No entries have been dropped.</p>}<p><a href={toHref('downloads/release-note.md')}>Status counts and release note</a></p></div></Layout>
